vision & ratios"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-150837-i20260601-v2","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-707","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-150837-i20260601","date":"2026-06-01","original_code":"746.707","severity":"medium","severity_label":"Medium risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2026-07-02","finding":"Incident/Illness Report Form Shared with Parent: During the inspection, the director was asked to provide incident and injury reports for multiple events, including two children leaving the operation unsupervised and a child sustaining a broken arm. The director stated that no reports were completed or available.","topic":"supervision","source_record_id":"1026583953","violation_type_title":"Incident/Illness Report Form Shared with Parent (26 TAC §746.707)","topic_label":"Supervision & ratios"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-150837-i20260601-v3","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-1205-a-4","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-150837-i20260601","date":"2026-06-01","original_code":"746.1205(a)(4)","severity":"high","severity_label":"High risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2026-07-02","finding":"Supervision ensures each child?s safety, well-being, including physical proximity and auditory or visual awareness of each child?s on going activity: Information gathered during the investigation indicates that the operation did not provide appropriate supervision to children in care. During two separate incidents, children left the building without staff awareness or supervision.","topic":"supervision","source_record_id":"1026583952","violation_type_title":"Supervision ensures each child?s safety, well-being, including physical proximity and auditory or visual awareness of each child?s on going activity (26 TAC §746.1205(a)(4))","topic_label":"Supervision & ratios"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-150837-i20260601-v4","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-1003-1","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-150837-i20260601","date":"2026-06-01","original_code":"746.1003(1)","severity":"high","severity_label":"High risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2026-07-02","finding":"Director Responsibilities - Operate in Compliance: Based on a preponderance of information gathered during the investigation, the director failed to ensure the operation complied with required reporting, documentation, supervision, and emergency preparedness practices. The director was aware of multiple incidents involving children leaving the operation without supervision, a child sustaining an injury requiring medical attention, and ongoing safety concerns within the building; however, no incident or injury reports were completed or available for review. The director also failed to ensure fire drills were conducted, as they are documented.","topic":"supervision","source_record_id":"1026583950","violation_type_title":"Director Responsibilities - Operate in Compliance (26 TAC §746.1003(1))","topic_label":"Supervision & ratios"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-150837-i20260601-v5","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-3607-2","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-150837-i20260601","date":"2026-06-01","original_code":"746.3607(2)","severity":"high","severity_label":"High risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2026-07-02","finding":"Critical Injury - Give First Aid or CPR: Based on information gathered during the course of the investigation, a child was injured while on the playground, and caregivers did not assess the child for injuries.","topic":"staffing","source_record_id":"1026583951","violation_type_title":"Critical Injury - Give First Aid or CPR (26 TAC §746.3607(2))","topic_label":"Staff qualifications & clearances"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-150837-i20260601-v6","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-3701","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-150837-i20260601","date":"2026-06-01","original_code":"746.3701","severity":"medium_high","severity_label":"Medium-high risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2026-07-02","finding":"Safety - Areas Free From Hazards: Based on information gathered during the course of the investigation, it was determined that children have been allowed into the kitchen. The kitchen is an unlicensed space and has multiple hazards present.","topic":"safety","source_record_id":"1026583954","violation_type_title":"Safety - Areas Free From Hazards (26 TAC §746.3701)","topic_label":"Safety hazards"}]},{"id":"tx-hhsc-150837-i20260520","date":"2026-05-20","inspection_type":"Inspection","result":"Deficiencies cited","passed":false,"violation_count":1,"open_count":0,"evidence_class":"VERIFIED","provenance":{"source_id":"tx_hhsc_activities","source_record_id":"905759662","url":"https://data.texas.gov/resource/m5q4-3y3d.json?activity_id=905759662","retrieved_at":"2026-11-05T21:27:29.718Z","effective_date":"2026-05-20","evidence_class":"VERIFIED"},"occurrences":[{"id":"tx-hhsc-150837-i20260520-v1","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-1205-a-2","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-150837-i20260520","date":"2026-05-20","original_code":"746.1205(a)(2)","severity":"high","severity_label":"High risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Corrected at inspection","finding":"Responsibilities of Caregivers - Know number of children responsible for: Caregivers with four groups did not know the number children they were responsible for during inspection.","topic":"other","source_record_id":"1026261559","violation_type_title":"Responsibilities of Caregivers - Know number of children responsible for (26 TAC §746.1205(a)(2))","topic_label":"Other"}]},{"id":"tx-hhsc-150837-i20260518","date":"2026-05-18","inspection_type":"Investigation of a report","result":"Deficiencies cited","passed":false,"violation_count":6,"open_count":0,"evidence_class":"VERIFIED","provenance":{"source_id":"tx_hhsc_activities","source_record_id":"905906614","url":"https://data.texas.gov/resource/m5q4-3y3d.json?activity_id=905906614","retrieved_at":"2026-11-05T21:27:29.718Z","effective_date":"2026-05-18","evidence_class":"VERIFIED"},"occurrences":[{"id":"tx-hhsc-150837-i20260518-v1","violation_type_id":"tx-ta